  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tsoundfonts4u\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPartial mirror copy of now defunct soundfonts4u web site\n\t\n\n\n\n\nWayback Machine\nhttps://sites.google.com/site/soundfonts4u/\n103 captures\n2 Apr 2017 - 28 Mar 2025\nJan\tMAR\tApr\nPrevious capture\t10\tNext capture\n2024\t2025\t2026\n  \n About this capture\nSoundfonts 4U\t\nFree Quality SoundFonts (sf2)\n- for iOS apps (bs-16i, SoundFonts and JamKoo)\n- for Windows/Mac apps (sforzando, MuseScore and more)\n-General Midi SoundFonts \n\nThis aim of this site is to provide high quality\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/projectlosangeles/soundfonts4u.",
